:"The final act begins."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"【推しの子】-The Final Act-","overview":"アニメ化もされた大ヒットコミックを原作とする実写ドラマの劇場版完結編。生前の記憶を持ったまま、“推し”のアイドル・アイが極秘出産した双子の兄として転生した主人公アクアが、アイの殺害を首謀した真犯人を捜し求める。世間にアイの子どもであることを告白した兄アクア、アイの伝記映画で母アイ役を演じることになった妹ルビー、2人の葛藤を交えながら、アクアの壮絶な復讐の行方が描かれる。ドラマ版に続き兄妹役に櫻井と齊藤なぎさ、アイ役に齋藤飛鳥。ほか原菜乃華、茅島みずき、あの、二宮和也らが共演。","tagline":"終劇が始まる―"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDjV3nJWkrIeIrnJttqt4DSTuUI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aDjV3nJWkrIeIrnJttqt4DSTuUI.png","language":"ja","width":880,"height":346},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYHxMpE45w190myMxcw2ZMqlQXa.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wYHxMpE45w190myMxcw2ZMqlQXa.png","language":"ja","width":880,"height":405},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1XXrZQA03eXUUY3RuqEUICwjzIP.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1XXrZQA03eXUUY3RuqEUICwjzIP.png","language":"ja","width":479,"height":113}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29BjXB8dPvLvJJgZFetd8PvwYiw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/29BjXB8dPvLvJJgZFetd8PvwYiw.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zEHdxq1cFaR7cC4AnGeeAG18FeT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zEHdxq1cFaR7cC4AnGeeAG18FeT.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNvD1sbeMSsVL7m82U601JyGStG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNvD1sbeMSsVL7m82U601JyGStG.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qSPkLxzq2Uref7fRYQvLGNEXzRH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qSPkLxzq2Uref7fRYQvLGNEXzRH.jpg","language":"en","width":1382,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h8oAVINH9y3o2fV3n3H2Jpg0w5m.jpg","previewUrl":"https://